        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This is nothing.&nbsp; I stole the idea of the Bad Idea Thread from the Whateley Universe forums, where their Bad Idea Thread is over 1500 posts long and includes such delightful morsels (warning: not for the faint of stomach) as <a href=\"http://whateleyacademy.net/index.php/forum/the-workshop/39-the-bad-ideas-thread?start=100#2807\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this</a>, <a href=\"http://whateleyacademy.net/index.php/forum/the-workshop/39-the-bad-ideas-thread?start=130#3855\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this</a>, <a href=\"http://whateleyacademy.net/index.php/forum/the-workshop/39-the-bad-ideas-thread?start=230#5845\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this</a>, and <a href=\"http://whateleyacademy.net/index.php/forum/the-workshop/39-the-bad-ideas-thread?start=1440#42306\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this</a>.&nbsp;(That last one actually got turned into a pair of characters in a serious story, by the way).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>…</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Foot eating thread?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>…</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Nevermind, I don't want to know.</p>",
